      "statement": "`StateStore.publish_transition()` publishes the immutable export before registering revision, export, state, event, and idempotency records inside one SQLite immediate transaction; a failure before commit rolls back authoritative database changes, so filesystem publication and database registration are deliberately not a single cross-filesystem atomic action.",
